{"chapter": "guide", "node_kind": "quote", "parent_tag": "04V2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$H$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$\\xi \\in \\mathcal{X}(T)$", "MATH_0006": "$H(T) \\hookrightarrow \\text{Aut}_{\\mathcal{X}(T)}(\\xi)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\phi : \\xi \\rightarrow \\xi'$", "MATH_0008": "$f: T \\rightarrow T'$", "MATH_0009": "$g \\in H(T')$", "MATH_0010": "$g \\circ \\phi = \\phi \\circ f^*g$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X}/H$", "MATH_0012": "$\\rho : \\mathcal{X} \\rightarrow \\mathcal{X}/H$", "MATH_0013": "$\\xi \\in \\mathcal{X}(T)$", "MATH_0014": "$\\text{Aut}_{\\mathcal{X}(T)} (\\xi) \\rightarrow \\text{Aut}_{\\mathcal{X}/H (T)} (\\xi) $", "MATH_0015": "$H(T)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\\end{quote}\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cfbdba8c80781526c6706e8150de0643c18b3602dea833dd064f617360ce7eef", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ce90544d3828f312340481a45ac88cc229dbe59caae45ac66458c817aa91c105", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack over <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> be a flat, finitely presented separated group scheme over <MATH_0004>. Assume that for every object <MATH_0005> there is an embedding <MATH_0006> which is compatible under pullbacks in the sense that for every arrow <MATH_0007> over <MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009>, <MATH_0010>. Then there exists an algebraic stack <MATH_0011> and a morphism <MATH_0012> which is an fppf gerbe such that for every <MATH_0013>, the morphism <MATH_0014> is surjective with kernel <MATH_0015>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5dc3ecd5e7187a871233fc5d3336e1ad81e83cb8d0b68518ce8d16b46fa6de86", "unit_id": "tag:04V2:item001-quote"}
